OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright and breezy day with
OL,6,Fsunny intervals and a scattering of
OL,7,Fshowers, becoming lighter and more
OL,8,Fisolated later in the day. Fresh to
OL,9,Fstrong northwesterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FShowers mostly dying out with
OL,12,Fjust the odd light one lingering over
OL,13,FShetland, and a few clear spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping. Winds will become mainly
OL,15,Flight.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FA mainly dry day with some
OL,18,Fbright spells, but the cloud may
OL,19,Fthicken enough to bring the odd spot
OL,20,Fof rain. Lighter winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
